*ident	"ub 0.2 - USB (ISP1160: Lightning VME, NetUSBee): /dev/ub0, /dev/dsk/usbN"
*
* UB - character and block driver; the host controller is polled from a
* user process (ubtool daemon), the class drivers live in the kernel;
* mass storage units are /dev/dsk/usbN (block) and /dev/rdsk/usbN (raw).
*
*FLAG	PREFIX	MAJOR	#DEV	DEPENDENCIES/VARIABLES
obcsn	ub	46
